WEBVTT

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.310
It's another day of hard 
training for Rock Lee!

00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:36.580
<i>There are twenty leaves.</i>

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:39.320
<i>If I can grab them all before 
they hit the ground,</i>

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:44.880
<i>I'll take Sakura on a date to that...</i>

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:47.290
<i>...fancy restaurant with a 
view of the night sky.</i>

00:01:47.710 --> 00:01:49.250
<i>But if I fail,</i>

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.590
<i>I have to go to the restaurant alone,</i>

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.420
<i>and bungee jump off the 
plateau five times!</i>

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:00.920
Konohamaru?

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:03.080
Nice job, Mr. Bushy-Brows!

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.060
You saw right through me, didn't you?

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:15.360
<b>I'm Going to Teach Konohamaru Kempo</b>

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.260
I have a favor to ask you.

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:19.860
Will you train me?

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:22.870
Training? But why me—

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.720
I know, right?

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.950
I'll be happy to train you!

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.740
Naruto!

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:29.390
Watch this.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:32.130
Sexy Sakura Jutsu!

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.630
A critical hit against 
one specific person.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:42.010
But you cheated, Naruto!

00:02:42.010 --> 00:02:43.990
She's way bustier than the real Sakura.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.640
Don't you see, Konohamaru?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:48.810
This version's way better.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.030
Sorry...

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:58.440
Stop screwing around with your 
stupid perverted jutsus!

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:05.010
You didn't mind when I used my
Sexy Man Jutsu on you the other day.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.950
<b>Ichiraku Ramen 
Half Price!</b>

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:10.240
W-W-W-What're you talking about?

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:12.620
I'd never get worked up 
over something so immature.

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:15.130
You sure? I've came up with 
one that's even more exciting.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:17.840
More exciting?!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.510
Sexy Manly Man Jutsu!

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.390
No! No!

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.540
Your jutsu has amazing 
destructive power.

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.940
With fearsome weapons like 
that in your arsenal,

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.950
why do you need me to train you?

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:43.820
I'm sure you already know 
that I can't use ninjutsu.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.190
I don't want you to 
train me in ninjutsu,

00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.040
I wanna learn hand-to-hand combat!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:50.450
Combat?

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:55.260
I heard we're going to 
have a combat test soon.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:58.860
Actually, I remember Kakashi-sensei 
talking about that, too.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:00.860
Something about how they
want to do a yearly exam,

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.220
to make sure everyone's in 
good shape or something.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:06.340
I see, it all makes sense now.

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:09.060
I'll be happy to help however I can!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.950
Nothing says training like 
sitting under a waterfall.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.730
It's one of the basics, right?

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:21.070
Let's begin, gentlemen!

00:04:21.070 --> 00:04:23.840
Say hello to my helpers, 
Neji and Tenten!

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:24.800
Helpers?

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.390
Do we have time for this, Lee?

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.700
We need to prepare for the exam, too.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.340
I'm not sure we should be worried 
about teaching anyone else.

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:35.740
No, I would never have become a chunin
if it weren't for Guy Sensei.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.200
Now it's time for me to start

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.840
helping the next generation of ninjas!

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:44.160
The most important part 
of fighting is speed.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:45.790
If you're fast enough,

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:48.920
you can produce the same 
effect as any ninjutsu,

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:51.020
even if you can't use 
 the jutsu yourself.

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.180
For example, the Transformation Jutsu...

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:57.270
And then taking it further!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.780
Wow, you changed Neji lightning fast!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.200
<i>Why do I agree to these things?</i>

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:10.460
The key to this technique 
is not to get embarrassed.

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:14.090
In that sense, Neji still 
needs to train a little more.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.760
Run a lap around the 
village in that outfit.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:19.880
Forget it!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.210
And you call this the 
transformation jutsu?

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.720
He's just changing his clothes.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.780
Moving on!

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:29.860
If you move around quickly enough...

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.070
I thought it was just a waterfall,

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.850
but there's a hot spring bubbling 
up from underneath, too?

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.980
You can use the...
Clone jutsu...as well...

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.420
Did he make himself dizzy?

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.940
And overheated.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.070
You really think it's on par 
with the actual technique?

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.500
Enough with the fake ninjutsu already!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.240
Teach the kid some kempo or something!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:58.260
Finally, the time has come for me to
teach you my greatest kempo move.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:02.460
A strike so powerful it can even 
counter Naruto's Rasengan.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.380
My Rasengan?

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.320
The Rasengan is high-level attack,

00:06:06.320 --> 00:06:08.880
where the user rotates chakra 
in his palm at high speeds,

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:12.690
compresses it into a ball, 
and slams it into his enemy.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.730
He's definitely spinning fast...

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.690
I call it the Rasenken.

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:24.400
You two give it a try!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.190
All right!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.700
Not bad. But not up to my level!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.030
You're not gonna show 
me up, Bushy-Brows!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:34.740
Faster!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.580
I'll show you!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.130
They spun so fast they 
made themselves drunk.

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.680
My plan worked perfectly.

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:47.800
I'll use the intoxication...

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.380
What're ya lookin' at?!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.380
The Drunken Fist!

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.300
Salary... man...

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.690
Why did he put his tie around his head?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.770
And why...

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.640
...does he have a box of takeout sushi?!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.440
There's... gourd and squid rolls inside!

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:05.880
Stupid boss...

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:07.500
Thinks he's so great...

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.990
All he does during meetings 
is dig in his nose.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.950
There's no fighting.. 
He's just plain drunk!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.160
C'mon, Naruto ol' buddy. 
Let's have one more round!

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:18.190
I can't tell where this 
training is going.

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.620
But it seems pretty strong!

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:21.460
Who does that jerk of a boss...

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.000
...think he is?!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.780
I'll get you for this, Bushy-Brows...

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:34.100
Now it's your turn, Konohamaru.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.100
Start out with the Rasenken.

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:37.900
M-Me?

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:41.630
What's wrong? Is starting 
with the big moves too much?

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:45.520
Okay, I'll teach you the trick to 
get the most out of your training.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.270
Guy Sensei taught it to me.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.780
It's called the self-imposed rule!

00:07:49.310 --> 00:07:50.690
Self-imposed rule?

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.080
Yes.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.510
You have to come up with a handicap for yourself during your training sessions,

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.700
and stick to it, no matter what.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.220
<i>If I complete this session,</i>

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.670
<i>I'll go on my first date with Sakura.</i>

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.370
<i>If I complete this session,</i>

00:08:09.370 --> 00:08:12.170
<i>we'll watch our first DVD 
together in her room.</i>

00:08:13.280 --> 00:08:15.260
<i>If I complete this session,</i>

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:18.390
<i>we'll go on our first overnight 
trip to a hot springs!</i>

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:21.380
If I complete this session,

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.730
<i>I'll buy an engagement ring...</i>

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:25.310
<i>...that costs three month's salary, 
and propose to Sakura!</i>

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:30.730
<b>Marriage Press Conference</b>

00:08:25.990 --> 00:08:28.020
<i>If I complete this session,</i>

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.730
<i>I'll hold a press conference 
to publicize our marriage!</i>

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.070
<i>If I complete this session,</i>

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.360
<i>Sakura and I will have healthy twin boys.</i>

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.740
<i>And of course, we'll name 
them Samohan and Yun-Pyou!</i>

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:44.110
For the record, in my head I've gone
on three dates with Sakura.

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:48.420
We've gone as far as holding hands
in front of the giraffes at the zoo.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.670
T-That's so creepy, Bushy-Brows.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.540
Now let's get to work, Konohamaru!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:57.420
Are those—

00:08:57.420 --> 00:08:58.510
His eyebrows!

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:01.430
He's spinning those huge eyebrows 
around like a buzz saw!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.410
Precisely.

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.180
By opening the internal limiters 
known as the eight gates,

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.000
I can call upon amazing powers.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.250
For this move,

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.950
I released the limiters 
on one specific body part!

00:09:12.680 --> 00:09:14.440
If you master hand-to-hand 
combat like I have,

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:16.150
you can use these moves, too!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.330
Still creepy, Bushy-Brows!

00:09:17.330 --> 00:09:18.320
Whoa—

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:21.080
His eyebrows are smacking me!

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.900
Konohamaru!

00:09:30.680 --> 00:09:32.080
Konohamaru?

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:35.420
What's the matter?

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.930
Sulking's not going 
to help you progress.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.800
You're the one who came to me for help.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:45.350
The truth is... I'm kinda scared.

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:50.340
I keep hearing rumors about how
tough the exam's gonna be.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.190
And I wonder if I can do it...

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.650
I've got no confidence.

00:09:58.850 --> 00:09:59.990
Konohamaru.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:06.460
No amount of hard work will help a man
who doesn't believe in himself!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:12.630
I can't tell you how many times
Guy Sensei's told me that.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.600
He said it over and over,

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:21.010
and eventually I understood how
important it is to believe in yourself.

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:25.540
It's thanks to his words 
that I became a chunin.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.510
So...

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:30.930
You'll be all right!

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.730
Konohamaru, you'll fight 
your way through just fine!

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.550
Have confidence in yourself.

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.030
I did it once, too!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:47.240
If I pass the combat test, 
then I'll become Hokage.

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:49.990
And if I fail, I'll run 500 laps 
around the village, backwards.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.710
That's my self-imposed rule!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:54.130
That's the spirit.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:57.420
Before you go, how about 
a quick spar with me?

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:03.560
Behold my new Harem Jutsu!

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:07.790
N-N-New Harem Jutsu?!

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:08.940
What will it be?

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:10.230
M-Maybe...

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.150
Sexy Manly Man Madness Jutsu!

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:26.740
I did it!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:31.520
Konohamaru overcame a huge obstacle
and completed his training.

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.290
Finally, the day of the exam arrived.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:36.920
Here's the examination room.

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:41.060
What's going on?

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.090
I thought this was a combat examination?

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.760
Combat?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.050
What're you talking about?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.280
Not combat, body fat!

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.140
Gotta make sure we're all healthy!

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:57.990
Lee?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:08.370
<b>A Ninja's Teeth 
Are His Life</b>

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.240
Yes, the test was actually 
a comprehensive physical,

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.370
and Lee has to take it, too.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:12.120
First they'll need a chakra 
sample to run some tests on.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:13.330
Chakra sample?

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:14.710
Indeed.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.040
In the morning, 
fill a container with your chakra,

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.300
and they'll run several lab tests 
to determine your overall health!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.720
Wow, they can do that with chakra?

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:25.010
Of course, Tenten. Didn't you know?

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:29.220
Anyway, they just started 
doing it this year.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.220
Naruto Uzumaki

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:32.390
She's all filled up, Doc!

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.890
That's just ridiculous!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.820
Make sure you only bring in 
your own chakra, everyone!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:43.610
No using your dad's or your dog's chakra
if you can't make any yourself.

00:12:45.710 --> 00:12:48.050
If you didn't remember to bring 
a sample, you can do it now.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.460
Just leave the container in this box.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:51.830
Yes, sir.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:54.540
So chakra's like that, huh?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.250
I had no idea...

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:06.260
<b>I Save My Lucky Undies for Physicals</b>

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.260
Naruto Uzumaki

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.260
Sakura Haruno

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.260
<b>Chakra Collection Box</b>

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.490
What's the holdup, Lee?

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:13.930
Give them a chakra sample so we
can move on to the physical.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:18.390
It's no use. I can't do it.

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:22.240
Even if it's supposed to 
be for a health exam, I...

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.900
I...

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.690
Don't tell me...

00:13:27.690 --> 00:13:30.910
Is there something wrong with
you that you haven't told us?!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.350
I didn't take a bath yesterday!

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.010
Before I get a physical,

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.090
I always take a bath to clean myself up,

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.210
and then I change into a 
pair of clean underpants!

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.140
That's all?

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:47.420
The only thing more important than
wearing the right underwear to the doctor,

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:49.550
is wearing the right 
underwear into battle!

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.490
Exactly.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.540
I remember reading a story once...

00:14:03.870 --> 00:14:06.800
<i>Tomorrow they're doing physical 
exams at the castle,</i>

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.410
<i>but I have no underpants to wear...</i>

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.750
<i>This tattered old pair's 
too embarrassing.</i>

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.310
<i>I wouldn't be able to face the doctor!</i>

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:16.120
<i>You're...</i>

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:18.850
<i>The Wizard, Guy Sensei!</i>

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:20.770
<i>Have no fear.</i>

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.960
<i>Pippity Poppity Poo!</i>

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:30.760
<i>These boxers are so stylish!</i>

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:35.190
<i>With those, you'll be the belle 
of the ball— er, physical.</i>

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:38.080
<i>But the spell will only 
last until midnight.</i>

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:42.740
<i>After that, they'll turn back 
into your old, worn-out briefs.</i>

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:43.500
<i>Understood!</i>

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:53.370
<i>The famous doctor...</i>

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:56.540
<i>Soon she'll put her 
stethoscope on my chest...</i>

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:58.330
<i>Next.</i>

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.790
<i>Right here!</i>

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.550
<i>It's midnight already?!</i>

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:06.670
<i>Hey, get back here!</i>

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.130
<i>Doctor Sakura!</i>

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.810
<i>Aren't these...</i>

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:20.850
Afterwards, the doctor 
wandered the country,

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:24.890
searching for the one man 
the boxers fit perfectly.

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:27.990
When she found him, 
the two lived happily ever after.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.060
No, no, there is no book 
like that anywhere!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.320
What do we do?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:34.580
I had no idea today was 
gonna be a physical exam.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.240
Konohamaru... You, too?

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.500
My only chance is the Sexy Jutsu!

00:15:43.010 --> 00:15:44.500
Why me?!

00:15:44.500 --> 00:15:46.580
That's not right, Konohamaru!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.880
You're more stylish 
than the real Tenten!

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.590
Naruto told me that's a good thing.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:56.460
I heard everything.

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:57.510
Guy Sensei!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:16:01.670
I can't magically conjure up 
a pair of fresh underwear,

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.250
but here's the next best thing.

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:05.360
My freshly laundered 
traditional fundoshi!

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:08.200
Thank you, Guy Sensei!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:10.610
I'll put it on right away!

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.450
Turn back to normal first!

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.290
First is the eye exam.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.020
I've got this!

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:25.500
Byakugan!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.220
Where's the gap?

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:27.890
Right.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:28.500
Here?

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.130
Left.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.130
Top! Lower right!

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.590
Left! Right! Bottom! Lower left!

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:36.460
He's getting them all wrong...

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:41.140
No, he's seeing the girls' 
exam chart in the next room!

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.080
Left!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:46.860
Lower right, upper right!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.820
The chart for Byakugan users is here!

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.540
Byakugan!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:56.280
Right, left, bottom, lower right!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:04.120
Right eye, 38752.0.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.830
Left eye, 38781.5.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.090
Nice work, Neji.

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.300
Okay, next is hearing.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.510
Hearing? That's my specialty!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.370
Not sparring, are you nuts?!

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:20.910
Oh, my mistake.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.470
I hear you loud and clear...

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.020
Guts.

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.630
Hearing, hearing!

00:17:25.630 --> 00:17:27.970
That was stretching the joke 
too far, even for you!

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:30.690
We're testing how well your 
ears hear, all right?

00:17:34.660 --> 00:17:37.310
This is the theme to Make-Out Tactics,

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:39.370
"I only wanna Make-Out with You."

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.540
He's jamming to the beat.

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.540
Now for blood pressure.

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:52.930
No, not butt pressure!

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.280
Oh, my mistake.

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.510
You meant...

00:17:58.550 --> 00:18:00.140
Not butt temperature, either!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:04.350
This is more like a 
stand-up comedy test!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.120
Next we'll measure your height.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:09.470
Bushy-Brows, I bet I'm taller than you!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.650
I'll take you on.

00:18:11.180 --> 00:18:13.710
<i>If I can beat Naruto, 
Sakura will perform my physical...</i>

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:17.400
<i>...in a fancy exam room with 
a view of the night sky.</i>

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.360
I'll beat Bushy-Brows this year.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.770
What a brutal move.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.780
But I won't be left behind.

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.760
Take that...

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:39.550
Oh, it's on now.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.890
Gotta keep pushing...

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:55.030
One more!

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.900
Hematomas don't count!

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:07.710
You got more lumps than me, Naruto.

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:08.910
The last part's a health survey.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:12.130
Survey Room

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.710
Took you long enough!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:15.800
Sakura?

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.920
Oh, they're having you 
help with the physicals...

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.470
...because you know medical ninjutsu?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:25.120
<i>Sakura's going to do my exam!</i>

00:19:25.120 --> 00:19:28.220
<i>Maybe it's not a fancy room with a view,</i>

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:31.440
<i>but Sakura's still gonna 
listen to my heartbeat!</i>

00:19:32.240 --> 00:19:34.940
<i>She'll hear that it beats only for her!</i>

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:36.400
Okay, Lee!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.680
Yes!

00:19:41.420 --> 00:19:43.490
Take a deep breath.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:50.840
Too deep, just breathe normally!

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:51.560
Okay!

00:19:56.770 --> 00:19:57.920
I-Is that...

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.870
...the theme to Make-Out Tactics,

00:19:59.870 --> 00:20:01.760
"I only wanna Make-Out with You"?

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.790
<i>I'll express my feelings for Sakura</i>

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:05.970
<i>with the rhythm of my own heartbeat!</i>

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:08.930
Mr. Bushy-Brows has 
insanely coordination.

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:16.560
Looks like they really are 
holding health exams today.

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:18.560
He's such a doofus, ain't he?

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.300
We didn't come to peep on them!

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:22.490
We're supposed to steal 
their chakra samples.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.030
We'll be taking your 
box of chakra samples!

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:30.950
Fresh chakra sells for a 
lot on the black market!

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.040
People buy and sell chakra, too?!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.730
I don't think so!

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:40.210
Whoa, I used up too much chakra 
this morning, I'm beat...

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.880
Me, too... Looks like I gave too much...

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.890
Neji Hyuga

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.050
Neji, not you, too!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:50.060
Thanks for the chakra, suckers!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.170
Get back here!

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:52.520
Leave it to me!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:57.550
Konohamaru, it's time to put 
your combat training to work!

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:01.860
The Rasenken!

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.860
Naruto, throw us like 
you would a Rasengan!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.830
Okay!

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:11.330
Rasenken!

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:21.810
We got 'em!

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:26.760
Sakura, we got the chakra samples back!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:30.010
What happened?!

00:21:30.310 --> 00:21:34.260
Carrying them back in one 
big lump was easier.

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:38.400
Afterwards, they enacted a rule,

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:43.360
stating all chakra samples must be
no bigger than one spoonful.

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:22.080
Oh, Guy Sensei!

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:23.510
What's with the tent?

00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:25.010
Are you camping out during 
the next training session?

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:26.340
Nope, next week is...

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:28.910
"The Leaf Village Sports Meet,"

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:33.140
<b>The Leaf Village Sports Meet
Calvary Battles are part 
of the Thrill of Youth</b>

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:31.410
and "Calvary Battles are part 
of the Thrill of Youth."

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.140
I have but one job to do!

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:34.000
Preparing for the meet?

00:23:34.000 --> 00:23:36.530
No, staying up all night 
preparing and preparing myself...

00:23:36.530 --> 00:23:38.080
...to see my pupils victorious!

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.450
Please wait!

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:41.050
Guy Sensei, if you're not here,

00:23:41.050 --> 00:23:43.410
who'll make my special lunch 
with the little octopus...

00:23:43.410 --> 00:23:46.210
...made out of Vienna sausage?!

00:23:46.210 --> 00:23:48.500
I, um... I guess I will...
